<title>USA: Leawood, Kan., won by George K. Baum.</title>
<headline>Leawood, Kan., won by George K. Baum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Co. said it won $6.945 million of Leawood, Kan., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.1623 percent.</p>
